        {
          "id": 1209027253,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "This is a major change due to the way those menus work. Although I can see the benefit, for now I would prefer this being implemented as a simple keycode, e.g. when hitting Ctrl while the context menu is open, just using the field. In this way I think it would be much to intrusive and lead to a less usable UI.",
          "author": {
            "id": 2498449,
            "username": "rknall",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Roland Knall",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9e1d973c5007651b2ca47071f80324c2de5349d873e365cf0761df5542dfe382?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/rknall"
          },
          "created_at": "2022-12-14T12:25:25.036Z",
          "updated_at": "2022-12-14T12:25:25.036Z",
