        {
          "id": 1210506243,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I read this as your main concern is that a UI that the users are familiar with might change. Therefore I would propose to let the context menu look like this. This will look familiar to the users and is extended by a new feature.\n\n![grafik](/uploads/693e14c157206bd905cc80ee7ad16f1a/grafik.png)\n\nI would advise against making the layout of the context menu dependent on whether you click on the field name or the value. This will probably be very confusing for many users.",
          "author": {
            "id": 7625625,
            "username": "Developer-Alexander",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Developer Alexander",
            "state": "active",
